# Owner paste — one block per field / message (LOCKED 2026-08-01 — FOREVER)

**Owner order:** Stop mixing Subject + Body + labels into one fence. Bobby must copy-paste with zero editing.

## Hard rule (every agent, every product)

Whenever the owner must paste into **any** external UI — forms, consoles, **email compose**, support tickets, Meta/Play/AdMob/Unity/AppLovin, WhatsApp Business profile fields, etc.:

1. **Label OUTSIDE** the fence (plain text: `Subject:` / `Body:` / field name).
2. **One fenced `bash` block = only the paste value** for that one field or message part.
3. **Subject and Body are ALWAYS two separate blocks** — never one email blob.
4. No titles, bullets, “Subject:”, signatures-as-commentary, or coaching text **inside** the fence.
5. No markdown tables of mixed paste values for owner copy.

## Email / ticket template (mandatory shape)

Subject:

```bash
exact subject line only
```

Body:

```bash
exact body only
```

